"overall": "The psalm mostly sounds like prayer: the lament in the second half (vv. 20–26) is plain, grave and rhythmically sure, and the Latin figures ('com os nossos ouvidos ouvimos', 'a obra que operastes') are kept without strain. The weak spots are all in the first half: a few overlong or back-loaded cola (v. 6), some Latinate or abstract words ('poderes', 'carência', 'auxiliai', 'iniquamente'), and a couple of unidiomatic constructions ('achastes prazer', 'uma comparação').",
